@* LatihanSoal logo (BRD-10, D-118): the owner's hand-inked column (Assets/pro-b-ink.svg and pro-b-white.svg, "Concept B"),
   a fluted pillar that stands on a stack of books, because practice is the pillar of success. Both asset files hold the
   same path in ink #14181C and white, so wwwroot/img/logo-mark.svg holds it once as a symbol with fill="currentColor"
   and .logo-mark picks the colour: ink on the light theme, white on the dark one. The path is about 2 KB and the layout
   shows the logo twice, so it lives in that cached file rather than in every page (catalog HTML budget). The viewBox is
   cropped to the drawing with 2 units of margin. The wordmark stacks LATIHAN over a light blue SOAL. favicon.svg and
   favicon.ico use the same mark. *@
@inject Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.ViewFeatures.IFileVersionProvider Versions
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5" data-testid="logo">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="37.8 17.5 168.6 218.8" width="31" height="40" class="logo-mark h-10 w-auto shrink-0">
    <use href="@Versions.AddFileVersionToPath(Context.Request.PathBase, "/img/logo-mark.svg")#mark" />
  </svg>
  <span class="flex flex-col text-base leading-none font-bold tracking-wide uppercase">
    <span class="text-slate-900">Latihan</span>
    <span class="text-[#1d9bf0]">Soal</span>
  </span>
</span>
